  {
    "id": "card.ming.ziwei-ziwu.core",
    "palace": "命宮",
    "topic": "本質",
    "kind": "claim",
    "system": 1,
    "layer": "natal",
    "claim": "你主觀強、愛惡分明，下得了決定；你身上同時有兩面：一面重精神上的消遣和愛好，一面重物質享受、領導和組織。",
    "en": "You hold strong views, know what you like and dislike, and can make a call. Two sides live in you: one needs pastimes and interests of the mind, the other enjoys material comfort, leading and organising.",
    "limit": "原文說兩面都在，偏向哪面由會合星曜決定，不可只寫一面。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "wtz.deep.p042.b005",
        "sha256": "3a3979e47178c21cab2838457fae12d7466a3f563857f4a53de99f73bc60c147"
      },
