    "claim": "你容易進退兩難：不願聽命於人，又未必號令得動別人，卻不肯低頭，路因此走得辛苦。",
    "en": "You can get caught in between: unwilling to take orders, not always able to give them, yet unwilling to bow, so your road is a hard one.",
    "limit": "不見空曜；天空、截空旬空計不到。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "wtz.deep.p006.b008",
